Z||000010||Dragon||09-18-2001||10:43 PM||||We should be rolling in late Friday afternoon  - staying at the Cherokee Inn<P>The car is pretty much ready<P>New:  Kuhmo Tires<BR>      New Ball Joints Upper & Lower on front<BR>      New Bushings  Front & Back<BR>      Koni Shocks  (Lucky Junkyard find)<BR>      Spark Plug wires<BR>      Headlights and others<BR>      4 Wheel Alignement<P>That should do it for the trip  The Emerald Dragon has 224989 on the odometer tonight and is ready to go.<P>Time to have fun  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Frank Martin<BR>   Space Coast Fieros<BR>      Florida Fiero Weekend 2002 at Daytona<BR>||||reg||6
